sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Usuario
    participant F as Front (navegador)
    participant A as API (Express)
    participant D as BD (SQLite)
    U->>F: Escribe email y contraseña
    F->>A: POST /api/auth/login
    A->>D: SELECT usuario por email
    D-->>A: fila (con hash)
    A->>A: verifyPassword(plain, hash)
    alt credenciales correctas
        A-->>F: 200 { token JWT }
    else incorrectas
        A-->>F: 401 Problem Details
    end
    F->>A: POST /api/posts (Authorization: Bearer ...)
    A-->>F: 201 Created + Location
